.TH openalex-snapshot-download 1
.SH NAME
openalex-snapshot-download \- download the OpenAlex parquet snapshot from S3
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B openalex-snapshot download
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Syncs the official parquet snapshot (s3://openalex/data/parquet/) per-dataset into
<root>/parquet/. Works lands in works_aws/ and is auto-enriched into works/ unless
--no-enrich. Dataset list and disk preflight come from the published manifest.json.
Transfer tuning (--max-concurrent-requests, --max-queue-size, --multipart-chunksize) is
applied via a temporary AWS config without touching ~/.aws/config.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --no-enrich
Skip auto-enrichment of works (download raw works_aws/ only).
.TP
.B --max-concurrent-requests N
aws s3 max_concurrent_requests (default 10).
.SH EXAMPLE
openalex-snapshot download --root-dir /data
.SH SEE ALSO
openalex-snapshot-verify_download(1), openalex-snapshot-enrich(1)
